Title: In Silico Study of Micheliolide Derivatives as Potential Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer Drugs Targeting the Epidermal Growth Factor Receptor.
Abstract: To identify Micheliolide-based derivatives with favorable drug-like properties and inhibitory potential against the epidermal growth factor receptor (EGFR) using an integrated in silico approach.

